(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-06","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["程雾做过[[acoustic|声学的]]分析，却先让我听完一遍，才看响声的[[frequency|频率]]变化。六下短音后，低沉的第七声带着金属[[vibration|振动]]。这盘[[cassette|磁带]]不是事故记录仪：父亲上午录过我乘船的声音，送我回母亲身边；下午返航前又用剩下的带子录江声，警报响时机器还开着。老陈出示旧打捞清单，播放机与带盒后来从船舱工具箱取出，调查留过转录，原带返还后由他替家属保存。我听见父亲教六岁的我叫缆绳，我攥着纸巾，迟迟不肯摘耳机。","带速不稳会[[distort|扭曲]]人声，程雾只用温和的降噪[[filter|滤波器]]处理副本，原始转录另存。我们反复[[reproduce|重放]]警报后的声音，听清父亲喊：‘北闸先别开，我船还没回来。’要[[interpret|理解]]这句话，她让我连着前后听。远处有人催木材船离港，父亲问通知闸房没有。程雾不补听不清的字，只标出可辨的部分，我将三点三十六分的电话表放在旁边。","旧录音里的第七下[[toll|钟响]]低而长，每组警报的[[interval|间隔]]却并非毫无变化。B库的几轮声音连杂音都[[identical|完全相同]]，排列[[sequence|顺序]]也重复得分毫不差。程雾把两份声音接着播放，旧带里一声铁杯轻响，竟也出现在仓库录音相同的位置。那更像截掉人声后的复制片段，仍需查设备文件。我听着父亲的声音被切断，忽然觉得这比编一个鬼故事更狠。","老陈翻出旧维修[[handbook|手册]]，找到机械报警钟那页：七声[[signal|信号]]用于开闸前提醒。值班员核对了这个[[technical|技术性的]]细节，照片中的钟与C库清点照吻合。那不是气动爆破装置，只是一只机械钟。现行应急关闭办法要看闸房的[[manual|操作手册]]，不能照二十年前的页码动今天的设备。何警官让人暂停钟的清运，父亲修钟留下的字迹在放大照片里若隐若现。","我们只能从蓝粉和脚印[[deduce|推断]]有人搬过带涂层的设备，这条[[clue|线索]]还没给出姓名。老陈想起快印社替清运队[[print|印制]]出入凭证，店外堆过蓝涂层废桶。何警官送粉末做[[chemical|化学的]]检验，也请房东配合检查店铺。程雾封好磁带盒，把原转录复制给警方。傍晚手机亮起，民警请她去堤口核对照片位置。我拿起外套，终于没有再催她快一点。"],"en":["Cheng had experience in [[acoustic|acoustic]] analysis, but let me listen once before examining the sounds' [[frequency|frequency]] changes. Six short strokes preceded a lower seventh with a metallic [[vibration|vibration]]. The [[cassette|cassette]] was no accident recorder. Dad had recorded my boat ride that morning and taken me back to Mum. Before his afternoon return, he used the remaining tape for river sounds; the machine was still running when the warning sounded. Chen showed a salvage list: the player and case came from a cabin toolbox. Investigators had made a transfer, then returned the original for Chen to keep for the family. Early on the tape, Dad taught six-year-old me the word for a mooring line. Clutching a tissue, I could not take the earphones off.","Uneven tape speed could [[distort|distort]] speech. Cheng used a mild noise-reduction [[filter|filter]] on a copy and saved the raw transfer separately. As we repeatedly tried to [[reproduce|reproduce]] the sound after the warning, we heard Dad shout, 'Don't open the north gate yet. My boat isn't back.' To [[interpret|interpret]] the words, Cheng had me listen to what surrounded them. Someone in the distance urged the timber boat to leave; Dad asked whether the gatehouse had been notified. Cheng marked only audible words, leaving unclear ones untouched. I placed the 3:36 phone entry beside her notes.","The old recording's seventh [[toll|toll]] was low and long, but the [[interval|interval]] between warning groups varied slightly. The noises played at B were [[identical|identical]] even in their background hiss, repeating in precisely the same [[sequence|sequence]]. Cheng played the recordings one after another. A tiny cup clink on the old tape also appeared at the same point in the warehouse recording. It sounded like a copied excerpt with the speech removed, though the equipment files still needed checking. Hearing Dad's voice cut away felt crueller than a ghost story.","Chen found the mechanical bell in an old maintenance [[handbook|handbook]]: a seven-stroke [[signal|signal]] warned before gate opening. The duty officer checked that [[technical|technical]] detail. The pictured bell matched C's inventory photograph. It was an ordinary mechanical bell, not a pneumatic blasting device. Current emergency closure required the gatehouse [[manual|manual]]; twenty-year-old instructions were no guide to operating today's equipment. Officer He arranged to suspend the bell's removal. On an enlarged photograph, I could faintly make out the writing Dad had left when repairing it.","The blue powder and footprints allowed us to [[deduce|deduce]] only that someone had moved coated equipment; the [[clue|clue]] named nobody. Chen remembered the printing shop working to [[print|print]] passes for the clearance team, with discarded blue-coating buckets outside. Officer He sent the powder for [[chemical|chemical]] testing and asked the landlord to help inspect the shop. Cheng secured the cassette case and gave police a copy of the raw transfer. That evening an officer called, asking her to confirm the photograph's position at the embankment. I took my coat, finally without urging her to hurry."]});
